{"title": "Bhaalspawn", "pageid": 9273, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bhaalspawn", "categories": ["Cult of Bhaal"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Orin_the_Red.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Orin_the_Red.jpg/300px-Orin_the_Red.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Orin_the_Red.jpg/450px-Orin_the_Red.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Orin_the_Red.jpg/600px-Orin_the_Red.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Orin_the_Red.jpg/300px-Orin_the_Red.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Orin_the_Red.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Orin the Red, a prominent and flagrant <b>Bhaalspawn</b> appearing in Baldur's Gate 3</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Bhaalspawn</b> are mortals who contain the divine essence of the God of Murder, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/29px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/39px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>. Bhaal, and his Bhaalspawn each have a massive impact on previous installments of the Baldur's Gate series, with said individuals playing the roles of both protagonist, antagonist and other neutral NPCs.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"List_of_Bhaalspawn_appearing.2Fmentioned_in_Baldur.27s_Gate_III\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Bhaalspawn_appearing/mentioned_in_Baldur's_Gate_III\">List of Bhaalspawn appearing/mentioned in Baldur's Gate III</span></h2>\n<p>Some Bhaalspawn within the game do not appear directly, but are mentioned by certain characters.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abazigal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Portrait_Echo_of_Abazigal.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\">Abazigal</a>, a Blue <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon\" title=\"Dragon\">Dragon</a> and a member of the Five in Baldur's Gate II: Throne of Bhaal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Balthazar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Balthazar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Balthazar\">Balthazar</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a> and a member of the Five in Baldur's Gate II: Throne of Bhaal (Mentioned)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Gorion%27s_Ward\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gorion's Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Gorion%27s_Ward\">Gorion's Ward</a></span>, the protagonist of Baldur's Gate I and II (Mentioned)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Illasera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Portrait_Echo_of_Illasera.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\">Illasera</a>, an <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elf</a> and a member of the Five in Baldur's Gate II: Throne of Bhaal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Bhaalspawn\" title=\"Fallen Bhaalspawn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/38px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/50px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fallen Bhaalspawn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fallen_Bhaalspawn\" title=\"Fallen Bhaalspawn\">Fallen Bhaalspawn</a>, a competitor of Orin as Chosen of Bhaal. It is implied that this might be the same character as the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin the Red\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin the Red</a>, Chosen of Bhaal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helena_Anchev\" title=\"Helena Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helena Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Portrait_Helena_Anchev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helena_Anchev\" title=\"Helena Anchev\">Helena Anchev</a>, daughter of Sarevok and mother of Orin the Red.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarevok Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a>, the original antagonist of Baldur's Gate I, and potential companion in Baldur's Gate II.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/38px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/50px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sendai\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png/25px-Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Echo_of_Sendai.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Sendai</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a> and a member of the Five in Baldur's Gate II: Throne of Bhaal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/38px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/50px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Dark Urge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">The Dark Urge</a>, a unique player <a href=\"/wiki/Origin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Origin\">Origin</a> available in Baldur's Gate III.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Yaga-Shura\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Yaga-Shura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Yaga-Shura\">Yaga-Shura</a></span>, a Fire <a href=\"/wiki/Giant\" title=\"Giant\">Giant</a> and a member of the Five in Baldur's Gate II: Throne of Bhaal (Mentioned)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bhaalspawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Ico